msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:193
#. Diagram label
msgid "not yours"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:77
#. Diagram label
msgid "Not yours: left alone"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:81
#. Diagram label
msgid "Open the bean"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:40
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Opens and claims the bean, then turns the author's plan into beans, so a resumed session or another agent can pick up Task_Scaffold."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:51
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Owns its own loop: Gateway_LeanGreen, computed by decisions/lean-build-gate.dmn from the build result, sends 'not yet' back to Task_Formalize. The paper reaches Task_Validate only when it says green."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:186
#. Diagram label
msgid "Paper published"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:69
#. Diagram label
msgid "Plan the paper"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:179
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanClose: end the bean in a state that says why — complete and archive it, scrap it with its reasons and archive it, or record the blocker and hand it back. The one place resolve and archive are drawn; placed straight before the end so the engine's resolve sees nothing left but the archive step."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:82
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanOpen: check before you create, find out whose the bean is, and claim it — or leave it alone when it is someone else's. The one place a claim is drawn; the gateway after this reads which end it reached."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:148
#. Diagram label
msgid "Publish extracted statements"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:172
#. Diagram label
msgid "Published?"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:90
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Reads which end Process_BeanOpen reached. `claimed`: the bean is in progress and this process works it. `not yours`: a sibling session or a human holds it, nothing was written to it, and this process stops here rather than work a bean it does not own (bean-coordination)."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:173
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Reads which end Process_FolioReviewPublish reached. `yes`: Published, so the bean is closed. `no`: Changes asked, or Feedback in, so the work goes back to Task_AuthorBlocks with the feedback."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:156
#. Diagram label
msgid "Render PDF and HTML"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:164
#. Diagram label
msgid "Review and publish"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:141
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Run content validation over the folio: schemas, the content profile (formal kinds only in a paper), cross-block consistency and that the Lean builds. Loop back rather than rendering over a failure."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:104
#. Diagram label
msgid "Scaffold the folio repo"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:46
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Scaffolds the repo from the author's plan and writes every block, including every revision: GW_Published's 'no' branch returns here, not to Lane_Author."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:70
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Scope the paper: chapters, the blocks each needs, what gets formalised."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:95
#. Diagram label
msgid "Seed the work plan"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:78
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Someone else holds the bean; this run stops without touching it."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:149
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The paper draws on library sources; every statement quoted or extracted from them is published in an appendix page of the paper and in the shared extraction viewer, each linked to its library entry and section, before the paper is rendered. These pages are EXPOSITION about sources, never part of a proof: nothing published here enters a formal statement or its Lean sibling. The sub-process is core's, the same for every content type; the paper supplies only the page look."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:96
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The plan becomes beans, so a resumed session or a sibling agent can pick it up."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:34
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The plan set here — chapters, the blocks each needs, what gets formalised — is not revisited: GW_Published's 'no' branch re-enters Task_AuthorBlocks, not this lane, so a scoping mistake surfaces only as rework downstream."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:157
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Typeset the paper through LaTeX to PDF and HTML. Run `latex-preflight` first to catch compile-breaking source patterns before a full compile. The preamble, class and macros belong to the folio, never to the platform."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:140
#. Diagram label
msgid "Validate"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:56
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Validates and renders the Lean-green manuscript, calls the shared review-and-publish process (Call_ReviewPublish), and closes the bean once GW_Published says yes. It decides nothing itself."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:39
#. Diagram label
msgid "Work plan (beans)"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/collab/processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn:204
#. Diagram label
msgid "yes"
msgstr ""
